# Gradient types and modes.
doc 150 100
noise 13 random
fg FF8000
bg 2000FF40
tool Gradient
drag L 10 10 140 90 4
dump linear
set gradient LinearReflected
drag L 75 50 120 60 2
dump reflected
set gradient Diamond
drag R 75 50 100 80 2
dump diamond
set gradient Radial
drag L 40 40 90 70 3
dump radial
set gradient Conical
drag L 75 50 75 10 2
dump conical
set gradmode Transparency
set gradient Linear
drag L 0 0 150 0 3
dump transparency
set alphablend 0
set gradmode Color
sel-ellipse 20 10 100 70
set gradient Radial
drag L 70 45 70 45 1
drag L 70 45 120 45 1
dump overwrite-sel
